---
flowchart TB
    subgraph Local[Local development]
        Env[Local .env] --> Docker[Docker build and local container test]
        Docker --> LocalApp[FastAPI + LangGraph]
        Ollama[Optional Ollama gemma4:e4b] --> LocalApp
        OpenAILocal[OpenAI API] --> LocalApp
        LocalApp --> LocalMCP[Filesystem + Tavily + Fetch MCP]
    end

    Source[Source + Dockerfile] -->|gcloud builds submit| Build[Cloud Build]
    Build --> Registry[Artifact Registry]
    Registry --> Run[Cloud Run service]
    Env -->|loaded by deploy.sh| Secrets[Secret Manager]
    Secrets -->|OPENAI_API_KEY and TAVILY_API_KEY| Run
    DeployEnv[Non-secret environment variables] --> Run
    Run --> OpenAICloud[OpenAI API]
    Run --> CloudMCP[Filesystem + Tavily + Fetch MCP]
    Run --> URL[Public Cloud Run URL]

    classDef local fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#3569a8,color:#10233f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef cloud fill:#f2eaff,stroke:#7952b3,color:#25133f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef external fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#378357,color:#153c27,stroke-width:2px
    classDef secret fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#b87913,color:#4d3006,stroke-width:2px
